<title>UK: LME approves French aluminium alloy brand.</title>
<headline>LME approves French aluminium alloy brand.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) said the &quot;Refinal&quot; brand of aluminium alloy is acceptable for delivering against its contract with immediate effect.</p>
<p>The Refinal brand is produced by France's Refinal Industries S.A. at its 22,000-tonne a year refinery at Lomme, the LME said in a notice to members.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8080</p>
